<title>EGYPT: Egyptian inflation up to 5.7 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Egyptian inflation up to 5.7 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's consumer price index rose 5.7 percent to the year to the end of January, from 5.4 percent at the end of December and 7.1 percent at the end of January 1996, the government statistics office said.</p>
<p>The index for urban areas, set at a base of 100 in the financial year 1986/7, rose 0.4 percent in January to 375.7 from 374.2 in December. The index stood at 355.5 in January 1996.</p>
<p>					   Jan 1997  Dec 1996  Jan 1996</p>
<p> CONSUMER INDEX  base 1986/7	375.7     374.2     355.5</p>
<p>     Month-on-month		   +0.4	+0.2	+0.1</p>
<p>     Year-on-year		     +5.7	+5.4	+7.1</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
